    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-3a",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Gist</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>What is <em>Human</em> about?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">Interviews with 2,000 people around the world about their hopes, fears, and dreams.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>The film asks people from 60 countries the same 40 questions about their lives.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“…a documentary… based on interviews with 2,000 people in 60 different countries.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 1-9."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-3b",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Gist</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>How does it engage you?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">People everywhere give the same answers. It shows we are all human.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>Strangers around the world feel the same things about life — this is surprising and moving.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“surprisingly, the answers were often similar… He wanted to emphasize our sameness.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 36-45."
    },
