    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-q1",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Detail</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>What gave the director the idea?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">A conversation with a local farmer in Mali.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>The farmer told him about his life. The director realized it would make a great movie.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“He was talking with a local farmer and the farmer told him about his life.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 20-21."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-q2",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Detail</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>What questions do they answer?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">40 questions: “What makes you happy? What are you afraid of? What do you love?”</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>Each person answers the same questions. Students give their own answers.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“Each person was given a list of 40 questions… ‘What makes you happy?’”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 28-29."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-q3",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Detail</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>Is it surprising that answers were similar?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">Students’ own answers.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>The film critic was surprised. Strangers sharing the same feelings is unexpected.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“surprisingly, the answers were often similar.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript line 37."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-q4",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Detail</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>How were the interviews filmed? Why?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">Close up, looking at the camera. Dark gray background. No name or country.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>The director removed anything that makes people look different to focus on what we share.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“close up to the camera… dark gray background… no name or country.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 40-45."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
