      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-q5",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Detail</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>How are the interviewees similar?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">They love their families, worry about work, and want to be loved.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>Despite different cultures, they share the same everyday concerns and emotions.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“They all love their families, they all worry about work… They all want to love and be loved.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 53-54."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "id": "answer-q6",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Answers: Detail</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Question</td><td>What does the director want to achieve?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Answer</td><td><span style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700\">He wants to show that people are basically the same everywhere.</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Explanation</td><td>The documentary explores what it means to be human and emphasizes our shared humanity.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Transcript</td><td><em>“He wants to show us how we are all similar.”</em></td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Transcript lines 58-61."
