    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "speeddating-card",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<style>.card{border:2px solid #ffdd00;border-radius:6px;padding:20px 24px;margin:15px auto;max-width:750px;text-align:left;color:#fff;font-size:32px;line-height:1.5}.card h3{color:#ffdd00;font-size:38px;margin:0 0 10px 0}.card ul{padding-left:20px}.card li{margin-bottom:6px}</style><div class=\"card\"><h3>M3 Speaking Cue Card #1<br>Should we eat meat?</h3><p>Some people say eating animals is wrong. Other people say humans need meat to be healthy.</p><p><strong>Structure your discussion:</strong></p><ul><li>Open: \"We have an interesting question today...\"</li><li>Your view: \"I think...\" / \"In my opinion...\"</li><li>Respond: \"I agree because...\" / \"I see it differently.\"</li><li>Resolution: Agree / Partly agree / Disagree</li></ul></div>",
      "notes": "Walk through the card structure. This is what each card on the desk looks like."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "speeddating-instru",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#9b59b6",
      "title": "Speed dating",
      "body": "<style>body{color:#fff}.tb{border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px auto;max-width:800px;width:100%%}.tb td{padding:10px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-size:35px}.tb tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.lbl{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;width:120px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:46px;margin-bottom:10px\">Speed dating</h2><table class=\"tb\"><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Setup</td><td>10 cue cards on the islands.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Rounds</td><td>5 rounds of 2 minutes.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Rotation</td><td>Outer circle right. Inner circle left.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"lbl\">Goal</td><td>Read the card. Discuss. Try to agree.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Teacher: ring bell every 2 minutes. Ss rotate. Remind them to use discussion language and reach a resolution."
